# Clado API (Contact Enrichment)

Note: Clado is useful as a fallback when PDL does not return personal emails or phone numbers. For LinkedIn profile data (experience, education, skills), use Minerva `/api/minerva/enrich` instead.

## POST /api/clado/contacts-enrich
Enrich contact information from LinkedIn URL, email, or phone number. Must provide exactly one of: linkedin_url, email, or phone.
Price: $0.20 per request

Example:
```json
{
  "linkedin_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/satyanadella"
}
```

